<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAL" style="id" />
  <para style="h">MALAKI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk Pa Malaki</para>
  <para style="toc2">Malaki</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mal</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">MALAKI</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Buk pa Malaki </char> kicoyo ikine kare me mwaka miya angwen ma pud peya kinywalo Yecu Kricito, inge ma kigedo Ot pa Lubanga odoco i Jerucalem.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lanebi Malaki mitine tutwale onongo tye me lwongo ajwaki ki lwak jo Icrael ducu me roco gen gi ki gicikegi ikom Lubanga.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ikare meno onongo nyabo ki bwami dongo obwoyo lwak ki ajwaki. Miyo acel me apar ki mot mukene i Ot pa Lubanga onongo bene oloyogi woko. Dok pe gubedo kamiyo mot ma myero dok ma kakare. Kadi wa kwogi onongo pe myero, gubwoto bene pwony ma Rwot Lubanga omiyo botgi ma latice Moses otito pire.</para>
  <para style="ip">Rwot bene otito pi binone kangolo kop ki lonyo jone. Dok otito pi cwalo lakwenane anyim wek oyub yo me binone kun tucu lok me gicikene bot jone.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Bal pa jo Icrael <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAL 1:1-2:16">1:1—2:16</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ngolo kop pa Lubanga ki kica mere ikom jone <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAL 2:17-4:6">2:17—4:6</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 1:1" />Man lok ma pire tek ma Rwot oloko bot jo Icrael ma Malaki otito botgi.<verse eid="MAL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mar pa Rwot pi jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 1:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 9:13">Rom 9:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 34:5-17">Ica 34:5-17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:1-6">63:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:7-22">Jer 49:7-22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:12-14">Eje 25:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 35:1-15">35:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:11-12">Amo 1:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:1-14">Oba 1-14</ref></char>
    </note> Rwot waco bot jo Icrael ni, “An dong atyeko marowu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 1:2">Ento lwak gugamo ni, “In ityeko marowa ningning?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 1:2">Ci Rwot ogamo ni, “Ecau pe omin Yakobo? Yam amaro Yakobo, ento <verse eid="MAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 1:3" />akwero Ecau; ci abalo lobone woko ma obedo godigodi, dok amiyo lobo ma en oleyo bot too me tim.”<verse eid="MAL 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 1:4" />Ka jo Edom guwaco ni, “Kinginyowa woko piny, ento wabigedo wi oburwa odoco.” Ento Rwot me mony bidok iye kuman ni, “Gwok nyo gibigero gangi, ento an abireto odigi woko ducu piny, nio wang ma kibilwongo ni, ‘Lobo pa lubalo,’ ki jone kibilwongo ni, ‘Jo ma kiniga mako Rwot ikomgi nakanaka.’”<verse eid="MAL 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 1:5" />Wubineno man ki wangwu, dok wubiwaco ni, “Rwot dit wa inge apoki wang lobo me Icrael ikin lurok.”<verse eid="MAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot ojuku Ajwaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 1:6" />Rwot waco bot ajwaki ni, “Latin woro wone, ki opii woro ladite. Ci ka an a wonwu, pingo pe wuwora? Ka an ladit, ci pingo pe wulwora? Man lok ma an Rwot me mony aye aloko botwu, wun ajwaki, ma wucayo nyinga. Ci wun wupenyo ni, ‘Wan dok wacayo nyingi ningning kono?’ <verse eid="MAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 1:7" />Wucayo nyinga ki tyero cam me kwer iwi keno tyera. Dok wuwaco ni, ‘Watimo tim me kwer iye ningning?’ An dong awaco botwu ni wuloko mejana odoko gin acaya. <verse eid="MAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:21">Nwo 15:21</ref></char></note>Ka wutyero wa lee ma wanggi oto woko me gitum, meno pe bal? Dok wutyero gin ma ongolgu nyo matwo, meno bene pe bal? Kong wumii meno bot laloc mewu, ci wutamo ni cwinye bibedo yom ikomwu? Dok bitimowu ber? Man lok ma an Rwot me mony aye aloko.”<verse eid="MAL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 1:9" />Dong kombedi wun ajwaki, wuteme me kwayo kica bot Lubanga, wek otimwa ber. En pe bigamo legawu, ci man bibedo balwu. <verse eid="MAL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 1:10" />Rwot Lubanga owaco ni, “Kono kong onongo tye ngat mo ikinwu ma bicego dogola me Ot ma mera, wek pe wubimok mac ikom keno tyerna nonono! Cwinya pe yom ikomwu, dok pe abigamo gityer ki i cingwu. <verse eid="MAL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 1:11" />Pieno wunge ni cake tung kunyango nio tung potoceng nyinga dit ikin lurok, dok i kabedo acel acel giwango iye gin ma ngwece kur, me gityer ma cwinya opwoyo, ki gityer maber ma myero; pien gin ducu giworo an. <verse eid="MAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 1:12" />Ento wun wucaya kun wuwaco ni mejana konye mo peke, dok cam ma wun wucayo aye wutyero iwiye. <verse eid="MAL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 1:13" />Dok wun wuwaco ni, ‘Nen, gin man olowa tutwal!’ Ki dok bene wujwiya, man lok ma Rwot me mony aye owaco. Ka dok wukelo gin ma kimayo tektek bota, nyo ma ongolgu, nyo gin ma two, bene wukelo macalo gityerwu. Ci an abigamo gityer macalo kitmeno ki i cingwu? <verse eid="MAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 1:14" />Ngat ma laram ma tyero nyok ma konye mo peke ki ikin romine dong kicene woko, kun nongo idwole tye iye nyogi mabeco ma en ocike me tyero bota; pien An a Rwot madit, nyinga bene kilworo ikin lurok.”<verse eid="MAL 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 2:1" />Rwot waco ni, “Dong koni wun ajwaki, wunge man ni, lok man me cik tye pirwu. <verse eid="MAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 2:2" />Ka pe wubiwinyone, dok ka pe wubiketo cwinywu iye pi miyo deyo i nyinga, ci bimiyo acwalo can ikomwu, dok bene abicenowu woko; adada dong atyeko ceno jami ma wujenge iye woko, pien pe wuketo cwinywu me lubu cik ma mera. <verse eid="MAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 2:3" />Nen, abijuku likwayowu woko, dok abipuyu wangwu ki wee, en wee me gitum ma mewuni, dok abiryemowu woko ki inyima. <verse eid="MAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:11-13">Wel 3:11-13</ref></char></note>Kitmeno wubiniang ni ceng acwaliwu cik man, wek cikena ki Lulevi omok matek.<verse eid="MAL 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 2:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 25:12">Wel 25:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Cikena mayam acike kwede ki gin, yam obedo cike me kwo ki me kuc. Amiyo man botgi wek gubed ki lworo; ci gulwora, dok bene gubedo ki woro ikom nyinga. <verse eid="MAL 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 2:6" />Gin gupwonyo lok me ada, pe kinongo bal mo idoggi. Yam gubedo kweda ki kuc, kun cwinygi tye atir, dok gumiyo jo mapol guloke guweko timo bal. <verse eid="MAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 2:7" />Dong ajwaka myero opwony dano wek gunge Lubanga, dok dano myero guyeny pwony ma a ki idoge, pien en tye lakwena pa Rwot me mony.<verse eid="MAL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 2:8" />Ento wun ajwaki wuweko yo meno; wumiyo jo mapol gigate agata pi pwony mewu; wubalo bene gicike mayam acike kwedwu. <verse eid="MAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 2:9" />Pimeno abimiyo wubedo me acaya dok mayot inyim jo ducu, pien pe wulubu yona, ento wun pe otero dano maromrom ikare manongo wutye ipwonye mewu.”<verse eid="MAL 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dano guweko bedo lugen ikom Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 2:10" />Wan weng pe wonwa acel? Pe Lubanga aceli aye ma ocweyo wan ducu? Pingo dok ngat acel acel ikinwa turu cikene ki omine, kun bene wapyedo gicike ma Lubanga oketo ikin en ki kwariwa? <verse eid="MAL 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 2:11" />Jo Juda guturu cikegi bot Rwot Lubangagi, ci gutimo gin me kwer i Icrael ki i Jerucalem; pien jo Juda gupyedo kabedo maleng pa Rwot ma en maro, ka dok gunyomo kwede wa anyira pa jo ma giworo lubanga me rok mukene. <verse eid="MAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 2:12" />Rwot myero ojwer jo ducu ma gitimo gin macalo man ki i kema pa Yakobo, wek pe gukel gityergi bot Rwot me mony!<verse eid="MAL 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 2:13" />Dok wutimo man bene. Wudyako keno tyer pa Rwot ki pig wangwu, kun wukok, wucur iye, pien en pe dong keto cwinye ikom gityerwu, dok pe gamo gin ma wukelo bene ki yomcwiny ki i cingwu. <verse eid="MAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 2:14" />Ci wupenyo ni, “Pingo en pe gamo?” Pien Rwot obedo caden me cike ikin in ki dako ma i nyomo ikare me awobini, ma dong pe i geneni, kadi bed en gire obedo lawoti, en aye dako mayam icike kwede. <verse eid="MAL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAL 2:15" />Pe Lubanga aceli aye ma otiyo me kelo wun kacel dok en aye gwoko cwiny me kwo pirwa? En kono mitine onongo gin ango iyub man? Ni wunywal lutino ma giworo Lubanga. Pimeno wugwoke kenwu, ngat mo pe myero obed ma pe gene bot dakone ma en onyomo ikare me awobine. <verse eid="MAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAL 2:16" />Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael owaco kuman ni, “Adag gonyo nyom, ki ngat ma ryemo dakone woko tektek. Pimeno wugwoke kenwu, dok pe myero wubed ma pe wugene bot monwu.”<verse eid="MAL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nino me ngolo kop dong cok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAL 2:17" />Wutye dong kaolo kom Rwot woko ki lokwu. Ka pud dok bene wuwaco ni, “Waolo kome ningning?” Wun wuolo kome ka wuwaco ni, “Ngat ma timo gin marac inyim Rwot en aye ber, iye bene bedo yom ikome.” Nyo gwok pi penyo ni, “Lubanga ma ngolo kop atiri tye kwene?”<verse eid="MAL 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:10">Mat 11:10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:2">Mar 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:76">Luk 1:76</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:27">7:27</ref></char>
    </note>Lubanga ogamo ni, “Nen, abicwalo lakwenana cito anyim kayubu yona ma peya abino, dong Rwot ma wuyenyoni bibino oyotoyot i Ot mere. Lakwena me gicike ma cwinywu yom ikome, nen, en bibino.”<verse eid="MAL 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 3:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:11">Joe 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:17">Niy 6:17</ref></char>
    </note>Ento nga ma bitwero ciro nino me binone, dok anga matwero cung ka en binen? Pien en tye macalo mac me lalii ryal, ki dok calo cabun pa lalwok bongi. <verse eid="MAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 3:3" />En bibino ka ngolo kop macalo ngat ma liyo ryal wek obed maleng, ki bilonyo likwayo pa Levi, dok bilonyogi gidoko leng macalo dano ma liyo ryal ki jabu, nio wang ma gibityero macalo gityer ma myero bot Rwot. <verse eid="MAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 3:4" />Lacene gityer pa jo Juda ki gityer pa jo Jerucalem biyomo cwiny Rwot macalo ikare macon kit ma i mwaka mapol ma okato angec.<verse eid="MAL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 3:5" />Rwot waco kuman ni, “Abinyiko cok botwu pi ngolo kop; ki bene abibedo caden ma kome mit ikom lutal, ki ikom lutim abor, ki ikom jo ma kwongo kwong goba, ki ikom jo ma buru lupakaca pi mucaragi, ki ma buru mon to ki lutino kic, ki ikom jo ma ryemo lubedo ma ikin gi gicwalogi woko cen, kun pe gilwora.”<verse eid="MAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Culu dul acel me apar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 3:6" />Rwot waco kuman ni, “An a Rwot, ma pe aloke; pimeno wun likwayo pa Yakobo peya kityekowu. <verse eid="MAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 3:7" />Nia ikare pa kwariwu wungak ki i cik mera, pe wugwokogi. Wudwog cen bota, ci an bene abidwogo botwu. Ento wuwaco ni, ‘Wabidwogo ningning?’ <verse eid="MAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 3:8" />An apenyowu ni, ‘Ber ki dano mono me yako Lubanga?’ Ento wun wuyaka. Dok wuwaco ni, ‘Wayaki ningning?’ Wun wuyaka i dul acel me apar ki i gityer mewu. <verse eid="MAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 3:9" />Kicenowu woko dong ki cen, pien wun kacel ki rok mewu ducu wutye kayaka. <verse eid="MAL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30">Lev 27:30</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 18:21-24">Wel 18:21-24</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:6">Nwo 12:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:22-29">14:22-29</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 13:12">Nek 13:12</ref></char></note>Wukel dul acel me apar i ot ma mera, wek cam obed tye i oda; ka dok wutema, wek wunen ka pe dong abiyabo botwu wang dirica me polo, wek aony gum ma opong madwong ikomwu, man lok ma an Rwot me mony aye awaco. <verse eid="MAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 3:11" />Ci abijuku wa bonyo, wek pe otyek cam ma ocek i potiwu; nyig olokwu bene pe bibale. <verse eid="MAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 3:12" />Ci bimiyo dano me rok ducu gibilwongowu ni jo ma komgi gum, pien wubibedo i lobo ma cwinywu yom.”<verse eid="MAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cike pa Lubanga pi Kica</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 3:13" />Rwot me mony waco kuman ni, “Wuloko gin marac ikoma. Dok bene wun wuwaco ni, ‘Waloko ikomi ningo?’ <verse eid="MAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 3:14" />Wun wuwaco ni, ‘Woro Lubanga konye peke. Dok cobo cikene nyo bedo inyim Rwot me mony macalo jo ma kwero cola kono konyowa ki gin ango? <verse eid="MAL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAL 3:15" />Nia kombedi wan dong wabineno ni jo ma giwakeni aye gin lugumkom; dok lutim gin maracu aye limgi nya; pe meno keken, kadi ka gitemo Lubanga, gibwot gire.’”<verse eid="MAL 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAL 3:16" />Ci ikare meno jo ma gilworo Rwot guloko ki luwotgi; Rwot otero ite, ci owinyogi. Kicoyo buk me po ikom jo mayam gilworo Rwot dok ma gitamo pire. <verse eid="MAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAL 3:17" />Ci Rwot waco ni. “Gibibedo mera, mera kikome, inino ma abitic iye, dok abitimogi kica macalo dano timo kwede kica ki wode ma tiyo bote. <verse eid="MAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAL 3:18" />Ma omiyo wubipoko kin jo ma kitgi atir ki jo maracu, ki kin jo ma gitiyo bota ki jo ma pe gitiyo bota.”<verse eid="MAL 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAL 4" />
  <para style="s1">Nino pa Rwot tye kabino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 4:1" />Rwot me mony waco kuman ni, “Nino bibino ma wang calo keno ma mac tye iye; ci jo ma wake, ki lutim maracu ducu gibidoko calo reng kal. Inino ma bibinoni kibiwangogi woko, pe dok kibiwekogi kadi lwitgi nyo kadi wa janggi. <verse eid="MAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 4:2" />Ento pi wun jo ma wulworo nyinga, tek me lar ma mera bibino ikomwu macalo ceng ci bikelo gin me cango dano ki i derone. Wun wubibedo agonya dok ki yomcwiny madwong macalo roci ma gikato woko kun gia ki i dwol. <verse eid="MAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 4:3" />Wubinyono jo maracu piny, ci gibidoko calo putu matye ite tyenwu, inino ma abitic iye.<verse eid="MAL 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 4:4" />Wupo ikom pwony pa latica Moses. Cik ki gin ducu mayam acike kwede botwu ki i Koreb pi jo Icrael ducu ni wek gulub.<verse eid="MAL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 4:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mat 11:14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:10-13">17:10-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:11-13">Mar 9:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:17">Luk 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:21">Jon 1:21</ref></char>
    </note>Nen, abicwalo lanebi Eliya botwu, ma peya nino pa Rwot oo, en nino madit ki dok ma bikelo lworo bot lwak. <verse eid="MAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 4:6" />Ci en biloko cwiny wegi lutino ikom lutinogi ki cwiny lutino ikom wegigi, wek pe abin abal lobogi woko macalo gin ma kiceno.”<verse eid="MAL 4:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 4" />
</usx>